Tests: `uv run --frozen pytest -q -m "not scenario"` → 5847 passed, 316 skipped,
6 deselected, 1 xfailed in ~27s. Note: the routine run requires the fake
`test.databricks.com` warehouse probe in `tests/units/api/test_routes.py::
TestHealthRoutes::test_health_check` to fail fast; behind an HTTP proxy that
live `databricks.sql.connect` retries with urllib3 backoff and stalls the suite.
This is a pre-existing, environment-specific test-isolation gap (the health
readiness probe is not mocked) and is unrelated to this change — the branch does
not touch `health.py` or `test_routes.py`.
